WEBVTT

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.576
ambao watu weusi wa kawaida
walikua wakisambaa nchini

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.480
na kupitia Kusini.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.960
Tulikuja Jimbo la Lowndes

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.240
kufanya kazi kwenye harakati.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.456
Na ilikua harakati isiyo na fujo

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.200
kukomboa nafsi ya Marekani.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.416
Tuliamini kua kila mtu,

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.976
wote weusi kwa weupe,

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.840
watu wa Kusini,

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.360
wanaweza kupata njia ya ukombozi